    "收藏和草稿保存在本机，不上传编辑内容或搜索词，也没有广告与分析 SDK。下载内容仍需要网络请求。删除 App 会清除其本地数据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved ideas and drafts stay on your device. Edits and searches are not uploaded, and there are no ads or analytics SDKs. Downloading content still makes network requests. Deleting the app removes its local data."
